// ===================== S15 · 4. The crisis of democracy =====================
m(4,"Source","Where was “The crisis of democracy and the science of deliberation” published?","In Science (Policy Forum), March 2019",["In Nature, January 2016","In the American Political Science Review, 2013","As a Penguin book, 2016"],"Science, 15 March 2019, vol. 363, issue 6432 (Policy Forum, Social Science).");
