m(4,"Polarization","The more polarized and uncivil political environments get, the more citizens…","Follow partisan cues, or drop out",["Listen carefully to the content of messages","Join deliberative forums","Trust experts more"],"“The less citizens listen to the content of messages and the more they follow partisan cues or simply drop out of participating.”");
