m(5,"Ireland","Who made up the Irish Constitutional Convention?","A majority of lay citizens and a minority of politicians",["Only elected politicians","Only constitutional lawyers","A majority of politicians and a minority of citizens"],"“The convention featured a majority of lay citizens and a minority of politicians.”");
m(5,"Ireland","The Irish processes reinvigorated the political landscape after the political disasters unleashed on Ireland by…","The global financial crisis",["Brexit","A pandemic","The Troubles in Northern Ireland"],"“…after the political disasters that the global financial crisis unleashed on Ireland.”");
