m(5,"Mini-publics","What do citizens' juries, citizen panels, deliberative polls, consensus conferences and citizens' assemblies have in common?","Diverse participants, facilitated dialogue, civility norms",["They are made up only of elected politicians","They all have binding legislative power","They all take place online, without facilitators"],"“These all involve diverse participants (sometimes randomly selected), facilitated dialogue, and an emphasis on norms of civility.”");
