m(5,"Divided societies","Where does evidence show that properly structured deliberation can promote recognition, understanding and learning in deeply divided societies?","Colombia, Belgium, Northern Ireland and Bosnia",["France, Germany, Italy and Spain","The US, Canada, Australia and New Zealand","China, India, Mongolia and Japan"],"Colombia, Belgium, Northern Ireland and Bosnia.");
